FAQs:

Q: Is the platform HIPAA compliant?
A: We support Business Associate Agreements (BAA) and our architecture is engineered with HIPAA-aligned controls, including AES-256 data encryption and access logging.

Q: Can we integrate with our current EMR?
A: We support integration with most major EMR systems via HL7 or FHIR APIs.

Q: How is patient data protected?
A: Data is encrypted at rest (AES-256) and in transit (TLS 1.2+), with strict role-based access controls and audit trails.

Q: Do you offer two-way messaging?
A: Yes, patients can reply to automated messages for instant appointment confirmations and triage updates.

Q: Can we send voice reminders?
A: Our VoiceBot Studio allows you to create automated, natural-sounding voice call reminders.

Q: What happens in an emergency?
A: We provide an emergency broadcast feature that overrides standard queues for instant priority delivery.

Q: Do you execute Business Associate Agreements (BAA)?
A: Yes. We execute Business Associate Agreements (BAAs) for healthcare providers and enterprise clients needing robust data protection safeguards.